{% from "pay-button.njk" import payButton %}

<section class="pricing-hero">
    <h1>Start free. Pay only when we go to work.</h1>
    <p>We read your case at no cost. Then you choose how far you want us to take it &mdash; and you only ever pay the difference when you upgrade.</p>
</section>

<main class="pricing-shell">

    <!-- Why This Exists -->
    <div class="why-this-exists">
        <p class="tagline">Why this exists</p>
        <p>You've tried calling hospitals in China. <span class="highlight">They didn't answer.</span></p>
        <p>You've searched "best hospital in China for my condition" and got nothing you can act on.</p>
        <p>You've asked around &mdash; nobody you know has done this before.</p>
        <p>We're not a directory. We're a <span class="highlight">Chinese speaker with a phone</span>, and we know which department picks up and which one doesn't. We are the person you wish you had.</p>
        <p><span class="highlight">Free</span> &mdash; we read your case and tell you honestly whether China fits, and which hospital we'd point you to.<br>
        <span class="highlight">$199</span> &mdash; we put your case in front of two hospitals and bring back their written answer.<br>
        <span class="highlight">$649</span> &mdash; we run the entire journey, from case preparation to discharge handover.</p>
        <p>Or <span class="highlight">$499</span> for an independent <strong>MDT Review</strong> &mdash; several specialists assessing your case together, when a single opinion isn't enough.</p>
        <p>Start anywhere. Upgrade anytime &mdash; you only pay the difference.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 1: Free Case Review -->
    <div class="free-block">
        <span class="free-badge">Step 1 &mdash; Free</span>
        <h2>Free Case Review</h2>
        <p class="free-lead">Before you pay us anything, we read your case and tell you the truth about it.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>We read your medical records &mdash; in any language</li>
            <li>We tell you whether China is a realistic option for your condition &mdash; <strong>including when it isn't</strong></li>
            <li>We name <strong>one</strong> hospital we would point you to, and why that one</li>
            <li>A realistic cost range and timeline expectation</li>
            <li>Back to you by email within about 24 hours</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="not-included">
            <strong>What's not included</strong>
            <p>We don't contact any hospital at this stage, and we name one hospital rather than a list. Contacting hospitals &mdash; and bringing back their written answer &mdash; is what the $199 step is for.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="contact-new.html" class="cta-button">Start your free case review &#8594;</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps 2 &amp; 3: Paid coordination -->
    <h2 class="section-title">When you're ready, we go to work</h2>
    <p class="section-copy">Two levels of coordination. Both build on the free case review &mdash; if you start there and decide to go further, we pick up from what we already know about your case.</p>
    <div class="pricing-grid-local">

        <!-- Step 2: $199 -->
        <div class="pricing-card-local featured">
            <h3>Hospital Acceptance Check</h3>
            <p><strong>"Will a Chinese hospital actually accept my case?"</strong></p>
            <p>For patients with a specific condition who need a real answer, in writing, from the hospital itself.</p>
            <div class="pricing-price">$199</div>
            <ul>
                <li>We put your case summary in Chinese and send it to <strong>two hospitals</strong> &mdash; straight to the right department for your condition</li>
                <li>We put your specific questions to them, so what comes back is what you actually wanted to know</li>
                <li>You receive <strong>both hospitals' written answers in English</strong>: whether they will accept your case, cost range, treatment duration, earliest available date, and what they need from you first</li>
                <li>We confirm <strong>whether each hospital can support you in English</strong> while you are there</li>
                <li>We tell you which one we would choose, and why</li>
                <li>We give you the named contact in the hospital's international department</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="not-included">
                <strong>What's not included</strong>
                <p>No appointment booking, visa support, airport pickup, or coordination during your stay. Those are part of Full Journey Management.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="upgrade-note">
                <strong>&#128161; Upgrade within 30 days:</strong> your full $199 is credited toward Full Journey Management &mdash; you pay only +$450.
            </div>
            <p class="delivery-label">&#9201; Delivered in 4&ndash;7 business days</p>
            {{ payButton(site.paypalButtons.acceptanceCheck, 199, "acceptance-check", "Hospital Acceptance Check", "Reserve at $199 &mdash; we&rsquo;ll send a payment link &#8594;") }}
            <p class="payment-note">After payment: <a href="thank-you.html" style="color:#dc143c;font-weight:700;">Go to next steps &#8594;</a></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: $649 -->
        <div class="pricing-card-local">
            <h3>Full Journey Management</h3>
            <p><strong>"I'm ready to go. Handle everything."</strong></p>
            <p>For patients who have decided to travel. Most of this work happens <em>before</em> you land &mdash; so that when you arrive, nothing is left to chance.</p>
            <div class="pricing-price">$649</div>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Includes everything in the Hospital Acceptance Check</strong> &mdash; two hospitals contacted, both answers in writing</li>
                <li><strong>Before you travel:</strong> we prepare your full case file in the exact format the hospital requires, so it isn't sent back for corrections</li>
                <li>We obtain your <strong>visa invitation letter</strong> from the hospital</li>
                <li>We book your <strong>appointment with the specific specialist</strong>, on the dates you need</li>
                <li>We arrange <strong>airport pickup</strong> and your transfer to the hospital or accommodation</li>
                <li>A written <strong>pre-departure brief</strong>: what to bring, what happens each day, who you will meet, how billing works</li>
                <li><strong>While you are there:</strong> a named coordinator who responds within 4 hours on business days, and acts as your channel to the hospital for anything that needs confirming</li>
                <li><strong>After discharge:</strong> an English discharge summary, your records organised for your doctor at home, and follow-up check-ins</li>
                <li>If your dates shift or the plan changes, we re-coordinate it</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="not-included">
                <strong>What's not included</strong>
                <p>An MDT Review is a separate service &mdash; see below. We do not promise medical outcomes, and we do not cap hospital costs. English support during your stay is provided by the hospital; we confirm it is in place before you travel.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="upgrade-note">
                <strong>&#128161; Coming from the Acceptance Check?</strong> Your $199 is credited &mdash; pay only +$450.
            </div>
            {{ payButton(site.paypalButtons.fullJourneyUpgrade, 450, "full-journey-upgrade", "Full Journey Management — Upgrade", "Pay the +$450 difference &mdash; we&rsquo;ll send a payment link &#8594;") }}
            {{ payButton(site.paypalButtons.fullJourney, 649, "full-journey", "Full Journey Management", "Reserve at $649 &mdash; we&rsquo;ll send a payment link &#8594;") }}
            <p class="payment-note">After payment: <a href="thank-you.html" style="color:#dc143c;font-weight:700;">Go to next steps &#8594;</a></p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:18px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#66758a;">Can't use PayPal from your country? <a href="contact-new.html" style="color:#1e3c72;font-weight:700;">Message us</a> &mdash; we'll arrange another way to pay.</p>

    <!-- Independent product: MDT Review -->
    <div class="mdt-block">
        <span class="mdt-badge">Independent service &mdash; not a coordination tier</span>
        <h2>MDT Review</h2>
        <p class="mdt-lead">A second opinion from one doctor is a second opinion. An <strong>MDT</strong> &mdash; multidisciplinary team &mdash; is several specialists looking at your case <em>together</em>, in the same room, at the same time. For complex or uncertain cases, that difference matters.</p>
        <div class="pricing-price">$499</div>
        <ul>
            <li>We organise your records and distil them into a <strong>Chinese case summary with a structured question list</strong> &mdash; this is what lets the panel work efficiently on your case</li>
            <li>The hospital convenes a <strong>panel of specialists</strong> &mdash; typically 3&ndash;5 consultants from the relevant departments (for a cancer case: medical oncology, surgery, radiotherapy, pathology)</li>
            <li>You receive a <strong>written MDT report in English</strong>: the panel's assessment, their recommended treatment approach, the alternatives and their trade-offs, and any points where they disagreed</li>
            <li>What the hospital would still need from you in order to proceed</li>
            <li>A <strong>video consultation with the panel</strong>, with medical interpretation, so you can question them directly</li>
            <li>A follow-up call with us to walk through the report and what each part means</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="not-included">
            <strong>What's not included</strong>
            <p>No coordination of any kind &mdash; no booking, visa, pickup, or in-country support. An MDT Review tells you <em>what the right treatment is</em>. Full Journey Management handles <em>getting you there and through it</em>.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="delivery-label">&#9201; Delivered in 5&ndash;10 business days</p>
        {{ payButton(site.paypalButtons.mdtReview, 499, "mdt-review", "MDT Review", "Reserve at $499 &mdash; we&rsquo;ll send a payment link &#8594;") }}
        <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.92rem;"><a href="mdt-review.html" style="color:#1e3c72;font-weight:700;">Read more about how the MDT Review works &#8594;</a></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table -->
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:56px;">Acceptance Check or Full Journey?</h2>
    <div class="comparison-table-wrap">
        <table class="comparison-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
